&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-3 mb-0">Any N ≥ 2. Panes and gutters must alternate. Each pane carries its own <code>data-pa-splitter-size</code> / <code>-min</code> / <code>-max</code>. Any pane with <code>data-pa-splitter-minimize</code> can collapse to a rail — first / last panes dock against the container edge; middle panes collapse in place and split released slack between both neighbours. Panes without an explicit <code>data-pa-splitter-size</code> share leftover space equally.</p>
