                            <table class="pa-table pa-table--compact">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr><th>Attribute</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter</code></td><td>—</td><td>Marker. Required.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-id</code></td><td>none</td><td>Enables persistence under <code>pa-splitter:&lt;id&gt;</code></td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-step</code></td><td><code>10</code></td><td>Keyboard step in px</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-rail-size</code></td><td><code>40</code></td><td>Rail width in px (minimized state)</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-minimize-threshold</code></td><td><code>0.40</code></td><td>Drag snaps to rail below this fraction of the minimized side's natural min</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <p class="text-sm mt-3 mb-2"><strong>On each pane:</strong></p>
                            <table class="pa-table pa-table--compact">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr><th>Attribute</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-size</code></td><td>shared</td><td>Initial size (<code>px</code> or <code>%</code>). Unsized panes split the leftover.</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-min</code></td><td><code>0</code></td><td><code>px</code> or <code>%</code></td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-max</code></td><td>available</td><td><code>px</code> or <code>%</code></td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><code>data-pa-splitter-minimize</code></td><td>—</td><td>Marker. Pane can collapse to a rail (first / last dock at the edge; middle panes collapse in place).</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <p class="text-sm mt-3 mb-2"><strong>Accordion mode (auto):</strong></p>
                            <p class="text-sm mb-0">When the container is too narrow to fit all panes at their minimums AND there are 2+ minimizable panes, the splitter switches to single-pane-expanded mode — restoring one pane auto-rails the others. Engages and disengages automatically as the container resizes; adds <code>pa-splitter--accordion</code> to the root as a styling hook.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pa-card mb-4">
                        <div class="pa-card__header">
                            <h3>Keyboard</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pa-card__body">
                            <table class="pa-table pa-table--compact">
                                <thead><tr><th>Key</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr><td><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>↑</kbd></td><td>Move boundary toward start (shrink left pane)</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><kbd>→</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd></td><td>Move boundary toward end (grow left pane)</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><kbd>Home</kbd></td><td>Jump left pane to its minimum</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><kbd>End</kbd></td><td>Jump left pane to its maximum</td></tr>
                                    <tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Toggle minimize on the nearest minimizable neighbour</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-3 mb-0">Each gutter handles its own keyboard input. Tab focuses the next gutter; the "left pane" is whichever pane sits before the focused gutter.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pa-card mb-4">
                        <div class="pa-card__header">
                            <h3>JavaScript API</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pa-card__body">
                            <p class="mb-2">Auto-initializes on <code>[data-pa-splitter]</code> at <code>DOMContentLoaded</code>. For dynamically inserted splitters:</p>
                            <pre class="pa-code"><code>// Init a single element
PaSplitter.init(document.getElementById('my-splitter'));

// Init all uninitialized splitters in a subtree
PaSplitter.initAll(someContainer);</code></pre>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-3 mb-0"><code>init()</code> is idempotent — calling it twice on the same element is a no-op.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <style>
                @keyframes pa-blink {
                    50% { border-color: transparent; }
                }
            </style>

            <script>
                // N-pane demo — rebuild the splitter inside #multiPaneContainer
                // whenever the count changes. Each N persists under its own id
                // so switching back and forth restores per-N layouts.
                (function () {
                    var container = document.getElementById('multiPaneContainer');
                    var select = document.getElementById('multiPaneCount');
                    if (!container || !select) return;

                    var ICONS = ['fa-folder-tree', 'fa-code', 'fa-terminal', 'fa-flask', 'fa-chart-line', 'fa-circle-info'];
                    var FIRST_LAST_ICONS = { first: 'fa-folder-tree', last: 'fa-circle-info' };

                    function buildPane(i, n) {
                        var isFirst = i === 0, isLast = i === n - 1;
                        var pane = document.createElement('div');
                        pane.className = 'pa-splitter__pane';
                        if (isFirst) {
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-size', '220px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-min', '160px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-max', '360px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-minimize', '');
                        } else if (isLast) {
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-size', '240px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-min', '180px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-max', '380px');
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-minimize', '');
                        } else {
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-min', '160px');
                            // Middle panes can now also collapse to rail
                            // (post-edge-only-restriction lift). The slack
                            // released splits between both neighbours.
                            pane.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-minimize', '');
                        }

                        var icon = isFirst ? FIRST_LAST_ICONS.first
                            : isLast ? FIRST_LAST_ICONS.last
                            : ICONS[(i % (ICONS.length - 2)) + 1];
                        var title = isFirst ? 'Sidebar'
                            : isLast ? 'Inspector'
                            : 'Workspace ' + i;

                        var actions = '<div class="pa-card__actions"><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--xs pa-btn--secondary" title="Minimize" aria-label="Minimize" data-pa-splitter-toggle><i class="fa-solid fa-window-minimize" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div>';

                        var body = isFirst
                            ? '<ul class="pa-list-basic"><li>📁 src/</li><li>📁 demo/</li><li>📄 main.scss</li><li>📄 README.md</li></ul>'
                            : isLast
                            ? '<dl><dt>Type</dt><dd>function</dd><dt>Args</dt><dd>name: string</dd><dt>Returns</dt><dd>string</dd></dl>'
                            : '<p class="text-secondary mb-2">Workspace ' + i + ' of ' + (n - 2) + '</p>'
                              + '<pre class="pa-code"><code>// Pane ' + (i + 1) + '\nconsole.log("hi");</code></pre>';

                        pane.innerHTML =
                            '<div class="pa-card" style="height: 100%; margin: 0;">'
                          +   '<div class="pa-card__header">'
                          +     '<div class="pa-card__title">'
                          +       '<i class="pa-card__title-icon fa-solid ' + icon + '" aria-hidden="true"></i>'
                          +       '<h4 class="pa-card__title-text">' + title + '</h4>'
                          +     '</div>'
                          +     actions
                          +   '</div>'
                          +   '<div class="pa-card__body">' + body + '</div>'
                          + '</div>';
                        return pane;
                    }

                    function buildSplitter(n) {
                        container.innerHTML = '';
                        var sp = document.createElement('div');
                        sp.className = 'pa-splitter pa-splitter--horizontal pa-splitter--minimize-mirror';
                        sp.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter', '');
                        sp.setAttribute('data-pa-splitter-id', 'demo-multi-pane-' + n);
                        sp.style.cssText = 'height: 420px; border: 1px solid var(--pa-border-color); border-radius: var(--pa-border-radius); column-gap: 0.8rem; padding: 0.8rem; background: var(--pa-subtle-bg);';

                        for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
                            if (i > 0) {
                                var gut = document.createElement('div');
                                gut.className = 'pa-splitter__gutter';
                                gut.setAttribute('role', 'separator');
                                gut.setAttribute('aria-orientation', 'vertical');
                                gut.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
                                sp.appendChild(gut);
                            }
                            sp.appendChild(buildPane(i, n));
                        }
                        container.appendChild(sp);
                        if (window.PaSplitter) PaSplitter.init(sp);
                    }

                    var COUNT_KEY = 'pa-splitter:multi-pane-count';
                    var saved = parseInt(localStorage.getItem(COUNT_KEY), 10);
                    if (saved >= 3 && saved <= 6) select.value = String(saved);

                    select.addEventListener('change', function () {
                        var n = parseInt(select.value, 10);
                        try { localStorage.setItem(COUNT_KEY, String(n)); } catch (e) { /* quota / privacy mode */ }
                        buildSplitter(n);
                    });
                    buildSplitter(parseInt(select.value, 10));
                })();

                function clearSplitterStorage() {
                    var cleared = 0;
                    for (var i = localStorage.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                        var key = localStorage.key(i);
                        if (key && key.indexOf('pa-splitter:') === 0) {
                            localStorage.removeItem(key);
                            cleared++;
                        }
                    }
                    document.getElementById('splitterStorageStatus').textContent =
                        cleared === 0
                            ? 'No saved splitter sizes found.'
                            : 'Cleared ' + cleared + ' saved size(s). Reload the page to see the defaults.';
                }
            </script>
        </div>
